            <h2>
                HTML Learning
            </h2>

            <p>
                The previous example introduced the
                <code>&lt;h1&gt;</code>
                element.
            </p>

            <p>
                Opening tag:
            </p>

            <pre><code>&lt;h1&gt;</code></pre>

            <p>
                Closing tag:
            </p>

            <pre><code>&lt;/h1&gt;</code></pre>

            <p>
                The
                <code>&lt;h1&gt;</code>
                element represents the main heading of a webpage or major
                content area.
            </p>

            <p>
                It should be used according to document structure, not
                simply because you want large text.
            </p>

        </section>

